SUMMARY:The Mix and Mingle Saturday Night Dinner Party with 80s and 90s Mu
 sic!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\n**Great food\, great conversation and some of the best music from the 8
 0s and 90s — a fun way to spend your Saturday night!**\nJoin us for a re
 laxed and friendly Saturday night dinner party where you can meet new peop
 le\, catch up with familiar faces and enjoy an evening of conversation\, l
 aughter and classic 80s and 90s music.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social gro
 ups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly p
 eers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant
 : A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence -
  south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*Y
 ou can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you to the
  group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking found on r
 esidential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nDJ St
 eve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Mix and Mingle Sa
 turday Night Dinner Party!**\n\nCome on your own or bring a friend. We'll 
 enjoy dinner together\, mingle throughout the evening and let some great m
 usic from two unforgettable decades add to the atmosphere.\n\n• **Mix an
 d mingle** with a friendly group in a relaxed social setting\n• **Enjoy 
 dinner and conversation** while getting to know some new people\n• **Lis
 ten to great 80s and 90s music** throughout the evening\n• **Come on you
 r own or bring a friend** — everyone is welcome to join the fun\n\n**Eve
 nt Fee: $5**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance
  by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail
 .com)**.\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **your name** in the me
 ssage so your payment can be easily identified.\nCome hungry\, bring your 
 sense of fun and join us for a Saturday night of food\, music and good com
 pany!\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time after 6:30 for dinner
  and mingling\n\\*No extra fee for the 80s and 90s party after dinner\n\n\
 \*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetize
 r minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:*
 *\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps
 ://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yon
 ge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
