SUMMARY:The Ultimate 80s and 90s Saturday Night Dance Bash! (October 10th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nGet ready to turn back the clock and dance the night away to some of th
 e greatest music of the 80s and 90s!\n\nJoin us for a energy filled Saturd
 ay night at The Pheasant filled with great music\, dancing\, laughs and a 
 fun crowd.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipa
 te a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend wi
 th!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Ave
 nue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are 
 in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait sta
 ff or bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve
 's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n\
 n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Hos
 t )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Ultimate 80s and 90s Saturday Night Dance Bas
 h!**\n\nDJ Steve Flemming will be playing a great mix of familiar favourit
 es from two unforgettable decades.\n\n• Dance to 80s and 90s favourites 
 with songs that bring back some great memories\n• Enjoy a fun party atmo
 sphere with disco lights\, music and plenty of room to dance\n• Mix and 
 mingle with new people and familiar faces throughout the evening\n• Come
  on your own or bring a friend — just arrive ready for a fun Saturday ni
 ght!\n\n**Event Fee: $5**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or
  **in advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFle
 mming11@gmail.com)**\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **your name
 ** in the message so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nCome join u
 s\, hit the dance floor and enjoy a Saturday night filled with music\, mem
 ories and good company!\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any t
 ime between 8:30 pm and 10:00 pm (if you can)\n(arrive earlier if you like
 )\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or ap
 petizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transporta
 tion:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\
 nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk fr
 om Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the sta
 tion)
