SUMMARY:The Thanksgiving Pre Dinner Nature Walk and Ice Cream with Friends
 ! 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Come join us this **Thanksgiving** for a fun afternoon of ice cream\, autu
 mn colours\, a beautiful nature walk and good company! It’s a chance to 
 get outside\, enjoy the season and spend some time with friends—before w
 e all sit down together for a wonderful Thanksgiving dinner.\n\nJoined by 
 my other groups too :)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nHope you can join us!\n\
 nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**
 The Thanksgiving Pre Dinner Nature Walk and Ice Cream with Friends!**\n\nA
  few things to look forward to:\n• A relaxed autumn nature walk\n• Bea
 utiful fall colours and fresh air\n• An icebreaker game to help everyone
  get acquainted\n• Ice cream early on in the walk\n• Lots of time to c
 hat\, laugh and meet new people\n• A friendly atmosphere where coming on
  your own is absolutely welcome\nAnd after our walk\, the day isn’t over
 ! We’ll be enjoying a wonderful Thanksgiving turkey dinner with all the 
 Thanksgiving spirit that goes along with it.\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\
 n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous
  turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy the day!\n\n\\*Please note 
 we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 bl
 ocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we will meet outfront on the 
 patio/or just outside the patio)**\n\n**Event Fee: $5 (Covers the Walk por
 tion of the Event and Entrance into the Post Dinner Party)**\nPayment can 
 be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance by e-transfer to Stevefle
 mming11@gmail.com**\n\n**When to meet?**\n-Arrive between 3:00 pm and 3:30
  pm\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue 
 and free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfi
 rkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n(15-20 minute wa
 lk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from th
 e station)
