SUMMARY:The Thanksgiving Cocktails and Desserts with Friends! (October 12t
 h) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Come celebrate Thanksgiving with friends over cocktails\, delicious desser
 ts and some great conversation in a warm and relaxed pub atmosphere!\n\nWh
 ether you’ve already enjoyed your Thanksgiving dinner\, are looking for 
 somewhere fun to go afterward\, or simply feel like joining us for drinks 
 and something sweet\, this is a chance to get together\, share some laughs
  and enjoy Thanksgiving evening with a friendly group of people.\n\n\\*Ple
 ase note that we are at The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub at 1999 Avenue Road (ro
 ughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence and south of the 401). We are in the back
  dining area—come find us!\n\nPlease arrive between between 7:15 pm and 
 8:15 pm if you can :)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\nEvent deta
 ils below:\n\nSincerely\,\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n────
 ──────────\nEVENT DETAILS\n**The Thanksgiving Cocktail
 s and Desserts with Friends!**\n\nCome join us for a relaxed Thanksgiving 
 evening centred around cocktails\, drinks\, desserts and good company.\n\n
 • Enjoy a cocktail\, beer\, wine\, pop or your favourite drink\n• Trea
 t yourself to something sweet for dessert\n• Relax and socialize after T
 hanksgiving dinner\n• A fun Thanksgiving icebreaker game to get everyone
  talking\n• Meet new people and reconnect with familiar faces\n• Singl
 es\, couples and newcomers are all welcome\n• A casual and friendly atmo
 sphere\nWhether it’s a cocktail\, a slice of something delicious or just
  the company that brings you out\, come spend part of your Thanksgiving ev
 ening with friends!\n──────────────\nFRIENDLY 
 REMINDERS\nEvent fee: $5 per person for reserved seating and event organiz
 ation.\nFood and drinks are purchased separately.\nPay the event fee in ca
 sh at the event or by e-transfer in advance to:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.co
 m](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\*Great drink\, dessert and food se
 lections available\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to s
 upport the venue\n──────────────\nPARKING AND 
 TRANSPORTATION\n\\*Lots of street parking on Avenue Road and free resident
 ial parking\nThe Pheasant: A Firkin Pub:\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thep
 heasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n\\*1
 5–20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station—or simply take t
 he bus or an Uber from the station.
